.TH "MPI_WIN_CREATE_DYNAMIC" "3" "Sep 16, 2026" "" "Open MPI"
.sp
\fI\%MPI_Win_create_dynamic\fP — One\-sided MPI call that returns a window
object for RMA operations.
.SH SYNTAX
.SS C Syntax
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
